


.intro-box
  .intro-box__title Product Design
  .intro-box__text  Possesses a product mindset focused on UI/UX process experience, with the ability to seamlessly transition from design mockups to front-end implementation.


.work-box
    .work-item
        .work-item__content
            //- 375 X 810 
            iframe(width="350" height="660" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/M7ZbCu-J3vA?si=zW1aoLbOf3fEjGKc" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen)
        .work-item__descrip
            .descrip__box
                .descrip__h2 Interactive UI
                .descrip__h3 ＿Puzzle Verification
                .descrip__txt Tool : Angular + Angular Material CDK + SVG
            .descrip__box
                .descrip__title ACHIEVEMENT
                ul.descrip__list
                    li Image Slicing: Used SVG and CSS to slice images into puzzle pieces and backgrounds, achieving precise and flexible puzzle effects.
                    li Drag and Drop: Implemented the drag-and-drop functionality for puzzle pieces using Angular Material CDK.
                    li Precision Calculation: Calculated whether puzzle pieces were accurately placed within the allowable error range and displayed success or failure messages accordingly.
                    li Event Listeners: Deployed to monitor the start, progress, and completion of the dragging events.

    .work-item.work-item--left
        .work-item__content
            //- 375 X 810 
            iframe(width="500" height="600" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/CxAdQ90e5Ts?si=YBfMh0QumLSFwdqj" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen)
        .work-item__descrip
            .descrip__box
                .descrip__h2 Dynamic Color UI
                .descrip__h3 ＿Payment Page
                .descrip__txt Tool : JS + ColorThief + SVG
            .descrip__box
                .descrip__title ACHIEVEMENT
                ul.descrip__list
                    li Color Extraction: Utilize the third-party library ColorThief to extract colors from images.
                    li RGB/HEX Conversion: Generate corresponding RGB or HEX codes from the extracted color values.
                    li Dynamic DOM Manipulation: Use JavaScript to manipulate the DOM, updating the page in real-time with the extracted color codes.


.slick-item
  .descrip__box
      .descrip__h2 Iframe for Networking Platform
      .descrip__h3 @ XChange community
      .descrip__txt Tool : Figma
  .descrip__box
      .descrip__title ACHIEVEMENT
      ul.descrip__list
          li Led the creation of Iframes within the community.
          li Facilitated two-way communication to clarify product direction.
